<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Tokyo</title>

    <style>
        /* Basic Reset */
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background: #111;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: #222;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 12px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #fff;
            margin: 0 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* General Section Style */
        .section {
            padding: 60px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            border-bottom: 4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
        }

        /* Parallax Backgrounds */
        .bg1 {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505205296326-2178af1b47bf')
            center/cover fixed;
        }

        .bg2 {
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526481280695-3c720685208b')
            center/cover fixed;
        }

        /* Gradients */
        .linear {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #2c3e50, #4ca1af);
        }

        .radial {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, #ff9863, #b81a34);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #111;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Welcome to Tokyo</h1>
    <p>The City of Culture and Innovation</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#history">History</a>
    <a href="#culture">Culture</a>
    <a href="#food">Food</a>
    <a href="#places">Places</a>
</nav>

<main>

    <section id="history" class="section bg1">
        <h2>History</h2>
        <p>Tokyo grew from a small town into one of the world’s leading cities.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="culture" class="section linear">
        <h2>Culture</h2>
        <p>A mix of ancient traditions and modern lifestyle.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="food" class="section bg2">
        <h2>Food</h2>
        <p>Known for sushi, ramen and unique street foods.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="places" class="section radial">
        <h2>Places to Visit</h2>
        <p>Tokyo Tower, Shibuya, Senso-ji Temple and more.</p>
    </section>

</main>

<footer>
    <p>© 2025 Tokyo Info Page</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>

